1
00:00:01,292 --> 00:00:04,626
<i>Run, until we reach</i>

2
00:00:04,876 --> 00:00:08,876
<i>Until we reach you</i>

3
00:00:14,125 --> 00:00:16,918
<i>A sliver of a miracle</i>

4
00:00:17,626 --> 00:00:20,083
<i>We've encountered more</i>

5
00:00:21,209 --> 00:00:24,125
<i>Than we could ever imagine</i>

6
00:00:24,375 --> 00:00:27,125
<i>With every step
We take on this journey</i>

7
00:00:27,292 --> 00:00:30,626
<i>The goal is still out of sight</i>

8
00:00:30,834 --> 00:00:33,834
<i>But we can overcome anything</i>

9
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:37,292
<i>Just to see your smile</i>

10
00:00:37,417 --> 00:00:40,417
<i>If we wavered,
We couldn't shine</i>

11
00:00:40,626 --> 00:00:43,918
<i>We even strove to conquer
Our weaknesses</i>

12
00:00:44,042 --> 00:00:47,459
<i>We, who were truly devoted</i>

13
00:00:47,584 --> 00:00:52,751
<i>Have always been the same</i>

14
00:00:54,083 --> 00:00:55,417
<i>Run</i>

15
00:00:55,584 --> 00:00:58,501
<i>Until we reach</i>

16
00:00:58,626 --> 00:01:01,709
<i>Until we reach you, hey</i>

17
00:01:01,834 --> 00:01:05,917
<i>Less than legendary?
No problem! It's all good!</i>

18
00:01:05,918 --> 00:01:10,249
<i>Until the day we can laugh</i>

19
00:01:10,250 --> 00:01:15,000
<i>Follow the shining map</i>

20
00:01:15,167 --> 00:01:19,250
<i>So, no more hesitation, fighter</i>

21
00:01:19,584 --> 00:01:25,167
<i>It's gonna be alright</i>

22
00:01:31,375 --> 00:01:32,751
Nami! Nami!

23
00:01:32,959 --> 00:01:34,125
Hey, wake up!

24
00:01:35,250 --> 00:01:36,417
[NAMI groans]

25
00:01:37,709 --> 00:01:39,334
[grunts softly]

26
00:01:43,083 --> 00:01:44,584
Oh, my head.

27
00:01:45,209 --> 00:01:47,334
Guess I drank
too much last night.

28
00:01:48,083 --> 00:01:48,918
Wait.

29
00:01:49,584 --> 00:01:50,417
Huh?

30
00:01:53,792 --> 00:01:55,042
What the hell?

31
00:01:58,334 --> 00:01:59,459
Where am I?

32
00:02:02,584 --> 00:02:03,626
Huh?

33
00:02:06,709 --> 00:02:08,209
There's no one else here.

34
00:02:11,709 --> 00:02:12,792
Huh?

35
00:02:13,626 --> 00:02:14,918
What happened to me?

36
00:02:15,292 --> 00:02:17,417
[buzzing]

37
00:02:17,626 --> 00:02:18,459
[gasps]

38
00:02:18,959 --> 00:02:21,042
[eerie music]

39
00:02:21,626 --> 00:02:23,501
Great, now I'm hearing things.

40
00:02:23,876 --> 00:02:25,375
I'm more buzzed than I thought.

41
00:02:25,501 --> 00:02:26,626
[groans in pain]

42
00:02:26,792 --> 00:02:28,833
How did I even
end up in this place?

43
00:02:28,834 --> 00:02:29,750
Think back.

44
00:02:29,751 --> 00:02:31,625
We sailed from Egghead
with the giants,

45
00:02:31,626 --> 00:02:33,166
and we all visited their ship.

46
00:02:33,167 --> 00:02:35,626
Then we had a big banquet
after Luffy cheered up.

47
00:02:35,792 --> 00:02:38,125
- [buzzing]
- [gasps]

48
00:02:41,042 --> 00:02:43,125
Oh, what is going on?

49
00:02:43,959 --> 00:02:44,875
No, focus.

50
00:02:44,876 --> 00:02:46,166
I need to get it together

51
00:02:46,167 --> 00:02:48,292
and start looking for Luffy
and the others.

52
00:02:51,292 --> 00:02:52,459
[gasps]

53
00:02:52,584 --> 00:02:53,918
[screaming]

54
00:02:58,459 --> 00:03:02,125
"Nami in a Fix!
An Adventure in Block Kingdom".

55
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:07,667
[dramatic music plays]

56
00:03:10,250 --> 00:03:11,375
This is terrible!

57
00:03:11,709 --> 00:03:13,876
A fire in the woods?

58
00:03:14,083 --> 00:03:15,792
What does it smell like?

59
00:03:16,167 --> 00:03:18,417
Get water
from the spring, hurry!

60
00:03:19,167 --> 00:03:22,083
If Yggdrasil catches fire,
we're all done for it!

61
00:03:23,584 --> 00:03:24,417
Huh?

62
00:03:24,918 --> 00:03:26,458
What are those?

63
00:03:26,459 --> 00:03:27,501
Huh?

64
00:03:34,501 --> 00:03:36,501
A pair of Stingmores.

65
00:03:36,626 --> 00:03:38,876
It looks like
they've been beaten up.

66
00:03:39,751 --> 00:03:41,458
The people of the forest came,

67
00:03:41,459 --> 00:03:43,584
and they spoke
of a great calamity.

68
00:03:44,000 --> 00:03:46,291
That tremor we felt was
the Ear God falling!

69
00:03:46,292 --> 00:03:47,917
But how could that be?

70
00:03:47,918 --> 00:03:50,459
Who could fail
a giant rabbit so fierce?

71
00:03:50,584 --> 00:03:53,751
We need to report this disaster
to the Sun God at once!

72
00:03:57,083 --> 00:03:59,042
Ew! It's still alive! Kill it!

73
00:03:59,292 --> 00:04:00,751
[screaming]

74
00:04:01,918 --> 00:04:05,792
Nobody messes with Nami
on my watch, buddy bee!

75
00:04:11,292 --> 00:04:12,626
[laughs]

76
00:04:15,292 --> 00:04:17,709
[cries]

77
00:04:18,209 --> 00:04:21,417
Why does this castle
have supersized bees?

78
00:04:21,542 --> 00:04:23,834
Well, good morning, Nami.

79
00:04:24,000 --> 00:04:25,709
What is this place?

80
00:04:25,834 --> 00:04:27,042
No clue.

81
00:04:27,459 --> 00:04:30,125
We were riding
on the giant ship last I knew.

82
00:04:31,709 --> 00:04:33,208
It's like a bad dream.

83
00:04:33,209 --> 00:04:34,250
What gives?

84
00:04:34,709 --> 00:04:36,292
And whose castle is this?

85
00:04:37,250 --> 00:04:38,542
Am I going crazy?

86
00:04:38,792 --> 00:04:40,459
I don't remember
changing clothes!

87
00:04:40,876 --> 00:04:43,000
[yawns]

88
00:04:43,876 --> 00:04:45,791
Well, I'm going back to sleep.

89
00:04:45,792 --> 00:04:47,834
I hope you
figure everything out!

90
00:04:47,959 --> 00:04:49,959
What? Hey!

91
00:04:50,834 --> 00:04:52,918
Seriously? You're abandoning me?

92
00:04:53,083 --> 00:04:54,334
Zeus, you jerk!

93
00:04:54,751 --> 00:04:56,542
Come on, get back here!

94
00:04:58,626 --> 00:05:02,876
Somebody, please help me!

95
00:05:03,167 --> 00:05:04,501
Luffy!

96
00:05:04,626 --> 00:05:05,876
Zoro!

97
00:05:06,000 --> 00:05:07,667
Or Sanji!

98
00:05:07,876 --> 00:05:10,167
I'd even take Usopp this time!

99
00:05:10,792 --> 00:05:13,667
[USOPP] Nami! Where are you?

100
00:05:14,292 --> 00:05:16,125
Oh! It's Usopp!

101
00:05:16,334 --> 00:05:18,000
[gasps]

102
00:05:19,959 --> 00:05:21,959
[groans] Ow!

103
00:05:22,709 --> 00:05:24,209
[exhales]

104
00:05:24,375 --> 00:05:26,167
What is wrong with this floor?

105
00:05:26,459 --> 00:05:27,875
Why is it all bumpy?

106
00:05:27,876 --> 00:05:29,626
- [heavy footsteps]
- [NAMI gasps]

107
00:05:33,250 --> 00:05:34,250
Huh?

108
00:05:36,542 --> 00:05:37,542
Me?

109
00:05:44,459 --> 00:05:47,584
[NAMI screams]

110
00:05:52,000 --> 00:05:53,208
Calm down.

111
00:05:53,209 --> 00:05:55,125
I didn't mean
to startle you, okay?

112
00:05:59,125 --> 00:06:01,209
Don't be mad, please.

113
00:06:05,000 --> 00:06:07,334
Whatever I did wrong, I'm sorry!

114
00:06:07,542 --> 00:06:09,667
Go away!

115
00:06:10,626 --> 00:06:12,542
[panting]

116
00:06:12,751 --> 00:06:13,834
He's slow.

117
00:06:13,959 --> 00:06:15,542
Guess his legs are pretty short.

118
00:06:15,667 --> 00:06:17,459
[screaming]

119
00:06:20,167 --> 00:06:22,333
Hey, Usopp! I know I heard you!

120
00:06:22,334 --> 00:06:24,459
Stop hiding and help me already!

121
00:06:24,584 --> 00:06:26,459
I'm over here!

122
00:06:27,042 --> 00:06:28,167
Thank goodness!

123
00:06:30,209 --> 00:06:31,167
[gasps]

124
00:06:33,834 --> 00:06:34,709
[meowing]

125
00:06:36,042 --> 00:06:38,125
Save me, Nami!

126
00:06:38,292 --> 00:06:39,667
Wait, you want my help?

127
00:06:40,000 --> 00:06:42,209
What the hell
even is that monster?

128
00:06:42,375 --> 00:06:44,042
[meowing]

129
00:06:44,292 --> 00:06:45,375
I'm in a fix!

130
00:06:45,626 --> 00:06:46,541
Fix it!

131
00:06:46,542 --> 00:06:48,333
Well, I don't know
what to tell you.

132
00:06:48,334 --> 00:06:50,208
I'm dealing
with a monster of my own.

133
00:06:50,209 --> 00:06:51,584
What is this place?

134
00:06:52,209 --> 00:06:53,209
[grunts]

135
00:06:54,042 --> 00:06:56,125
Hey, Zeus, you got
to get up and help me.

136
00:06:56,292 --> 00:06:58,459
Come on, Zeus, wake up!

137
00:06:59,375 --> 00:07:01,292
Get your lazy butt up now!

138
00:07:01,667 --> 00:07:03,042
[murmuring]

139
00:07:03,209 --> 00:07:05,291
Oh, hello! Is it time to eat?

140
00:07:05,292 --> 00:07:06,751
Because I think it's a snack.

141
00:07:07,042 --> 00:07:08,833
[screaming]

142
00:07:08,834 --> 00:07:11,167
He'll give you as many clouds
as you can stomach!

143
00:07:11,292 --> 00:07:12,292
For real?

144
00:07:12,459 --> 00:07:13,417
[gasps]

145
00:07:16,125 --> 00:07:17,291
It's time to grow!

146
00:07:17,292 --> 00:07:18,501
Leave it to me!

147
00:07:18,626 --> 00:07:20,459
[screaming]

148
00:07:20,667 --> 00:07:23,459
[growling]

149
00:07:26,751 --> 00:07:28,542
Do it! Don't hold back!

150
00:07:28,834 --> 00:07:31,334
[screaming]

151
00:07:33,626 --> 00:07:34,709
[NAMI shrieking]

152
00:07:34,876 --> 00:07:35,959
[screaming]

153
00:07:41,584 --> 00:07:43,209
I'm going to fall!

154
00:07:45,959 --> 00:07:47,000
Are you hungry?

155
00:07:47,167 --> 00:07:48,417
Chew on this!

156
00:07:48,834 --> 00:07:53,125
[shrieking ]

157
00:08:03,042 --> 00:08:04,083
[gasps]

158
00:08:04,626 --> 00:08:06,334
Huh? What?

159
00:08:12,709 --> 00:08:14,542
[groans in pain]

160
00:08:32,083 --> 00:08:34,834
[whimpering]

161
00:08:35,459 --> 00:08:37,083
[NAMI groans]

162
00:08:40,417 --> 00:08:42,250
Oh, we've definitely
done this before.

163
00:08:42,375 --> 00:08:43,250
Yeah, we have.

164
00:08:46,959 --> 00:08:48,375
Here it comes.

165
00:08:49,334 --> 00:08:50,542
Here we go.

166
00:08:51,334 --> 00:08:53,792
[USOPP and NAMI screaming]

167
00:09:03,209 --> 00:09:04,459
Help me!

168
00:09:09,792 --> 00:09:12,417
Can't run on this stupid floor!

169
00:09:12,626 --> 00:09:14,249
Yeah, it's crazy!

170
00:09:14,250 --> 00:09:15,459
What happened to us?

171
00:09:15,584 --> 00:09:16,833
How should I know?

172
00:09:16,834 --> 00:09:19,209
I just woke up
in this blocky hellhole!

173
00:09:20,375 --> 00:09:21,959
Uh, did I miss something?

174
00:09:22,417 --> 00:09:23,375
Anyone?

175
00:09:23,834 --> 00:09:24,876
Hello?

176
00:09:28,459 --> 00:09:30,417
[gasps]

177
00:09:33,167 --> 00:09:34,167
These clothes.

178
00:09:34,876 --> 00:09:35,918
This beard.

179
00:09:40,876 --> 00:09:43,375
Nami! Hey, wake up!

180
00:09:44,501 --> 00:09:46,751
Ow, ow.

181
00:09:46,918 --> 00:09:48,124
Oh, that didn't hurt.

182
00:09:48,125 --> 00:09:49,459
Ow, that hurt.

183
00:09:50,459 --> 00:09:51,501
What the hell?

184
00:09:51,959 --> 00:09:55,000
[growling]

185
00:09:58,667 --> 00:10:00,291
And then I was cat food.

186
00:10:00,292 --> 00:10:01,291
That checks out.

187
00:10:01,292 --> 00:10:02,959
I thought I heard your voice.

188
00:10:03,125 --> 00:10:04,792
But how did we end up here?

189
00:10:04,959 --> 00:10:06,167
[panting] No clue.

190
00:10:06,334 --> 00:10:07,334
Let's see.

191
00:10:07,542 --> 00:10:09,209
First we were
on the giant's ship,

192
00:10:09,334 --> 00:10:10,918
and then we got drunk.

193
00:10:11,042 --> 00:10:11,876
Huh?

194
00:10:13,167 --> 00:10:15,125
- Interesting drink you got here.
- Huh?

195
00:10:15,459 --> 00:10:16,834
Seems kind of strong.

196
00:10:16,959 --> 00:10:17,792
What is it?

197
00:10:17,959 --> 00:10:19,041
Absinthe.

198
00:10:19,042 --> 00:10:20,999
Have you ever heard
of it before?

199
00:10:21,000 --> 00:10:22,541
Also known as the green fairy

200
00:10:22,542 --> 00:10:23,626
thanks to its color.

201
00:10:23,918 --> 00:10:25,750
That drink, they said
too much of it

202
00:10:25,751 --> 00:10:27,209
can make you hallucinate.

203
00:10:28,876 --> 00:10:30,167
It's a dead end!

204
00:10:31,542 --> 00:10:32,792
[BOTH panting]

205
00:10:35,292 --> 00:10:37,167
That's a long fall!

206
00:10:38,167 --> 00:10:40,542
[heavy footsteps]

207
00:10:46,125 --> 00:10:47,958
What now? We need a plan!

208
00:10:47,959 --> 00:10:48,791
We're fine.

209
00:10:48,792 --> 00:10:51,166
You solved the mystery
just a second ago.

210
00:10:51,167 --> 00:10:52,125
Huh?

211
00:10:52,250 --> 00:10:53,584
There's a cat here.

212
00:10:53,709 --> 00:10:56,834
We both see it, but it can't
do anything to hurt us.

213
00:10:59,959 --> 00:11:01,876
because it's a hallucination.

214
00:11:04,584 --> 00:11:06,501
Do your worst, kitty!

215
00:11:13,250 --> 00:11:16,250
[grunts]

216
00:11:16,751 --> 00:11:19,542
Usopp, no!

217
00:11:26,459 --> 00:11:28,792
[growling]

218
00:11:29,751 --> 00:11:32,667
[USOPP screams]

219
00:11:32,834 --> 00:11:34,250
Usopp!

220
00:11:37,751 --> 00:11:41,792
[NAMI screams]

221
00:11:42,250 --> 00:11:46,959
[cheerful music]

222
00:11:49,042 --> 00:11:52,584
[hopeful music playing]

223
00:11:58,375 --> 00:12:01,501
[breathing]

224
00:12:06,250 --> 00:12:07,292
Oh.

225
00:12:08,792 --> 00:12:11,334
[groans] That's going to
leave a bump.

226
00:12:11,459 --> 00:12:13,417
How did I even survive that?

227
00:12:16,417 --> 00:12:18,124
[NAMI screams]

228
00:12:18,125 --> 00:12:21,000
Either that's Brook
or Usopp is dead!

229
00:12:21,584 --> 00:12:22,792
[screaming]

230
00:12:23,000 --> 00:12:25,918
[NAMI whimpers]

231
00:12:28,876 --> 00:12:29,959
Usopp, hey!

232
00:12:30,250 --> 00:12:31,250
[gasps]

233
00:12:33,209 --> 00:12:34,959
Come on, please wake up!

234
00:12:35,417 --> 00:12:38,501
Don't leave me alone,
you big jerk!

235
00:12:40,834 --> 00:12:42,042
Are you alive?

236
00:12:42,626 --> 00:12:44,876
[thumping]

237
00:12:50,709 --> 00:12:51,667
[screams]

238
00:12:54,209 --> 00:12:57,167
[tense music plays]

239
00:13:00,125 --> 00:13:02,250
[whimpering]

240
00:13:04,250 --> 00:13:07,375
[dramatic music plays]

241
00:13:14,501 --> 00:13:15,918
There's a lion too.

242
00:13:16,334 --> 00:13:17,959
Usopp, wake up!

243
00:13:18,083 --> 00:13:20,625
If you don't pull it together,
we're dead.

244
00:13:20,626 --> 00:13:22,709
Wake up, Usopp! Hurry!

245
00:13:29,250 --> 00:13:30,167
Huh?

246
00:13:30,375 --> 00:13:32,042
[roaring]

247
00:13:32,667 --> 00:13:34,334
[screaming]

248
00:13:35,626 --> 00:13:36,792
[roaring]

249
00:13:40,042 --> 00:13:41,959
Hey, I got your shield!

250
00:13:42,083 --> 00:13:44,000
No, go away, go away!

251
00:13:44,125 --> 00:13:45,751
We are so dead!

252
00:13:49,375 --> 00:13:53,083
[dramatic music]

253
00:14:04,501 --> 00:14:06,584
Nami!

254
00:14:09,125 --> 00:14:13,083
The punishment for making
my beloved cry is death!

255
00:14:19,876 --> 00:14:21,959
Ifrit Jambe!

256
00:14:26,501 --> 00:14:27,876
Three Sword Style.

257
00:14:29,709 --> 00:14:31,667
Gum-Gum

258
00:14:32,501 --> 00:14:34,209
Elephant!

259
00:14:37,876 --> 00:14:39,834
Épaule Dragon.

260
00:14:40,584 --> 00:14:42,250
[roaring]

261
00:14:44,125 --> 00:14:45,584
Twister!

262
00:14:50,167 --> 00:14:51,667
Whip!

263
00:14:55,918 --> 00:14:57,375
[tense music]

264
00:14:57,542 --> 00:14:58,834
Strike!

265
00:15:09,417 --> 00:15:12,209
[screaming]

266
00:15:26,083 --> 00:15:27,834
That was way too close.

267
00:15:29,876 --> 00:15:30,959
Huh?

268
00:15:32,334 --> 00:15:34,584
Okay, so it's a cat now.

269
00:15:34,959 --> 00:15:36,751
Wow, you're huge!

270
00:15:37,042 --> 00:15:39,459
Lucky for you,
I don't eat kitty cats.

271
00:15:39,751 --> 00:15:42,709
That supersized roasted rabbit
sure was tasty though.

272
00:15:44,459 --> 00:15:46,459
Nami, you're okay!

273
00:15:46,918 --> 00:15:49,501
I was so worried about you.

274
00:15:51,209 --> 00:15:52,459
Sanji!

275
00:15:52,709 --> 00:15:54,209
I was so scared!

276
00:15:54,375 --> 00:15:56,542
Usopp died protecting me!

277
00:15:57,000 --> 00:15:58,834
Sorry you had to
go through that.

278
00:15:59,083 --> 00:16:00,583
If it's any consolation,

279
00:16:00,584 --> 00:16:02,417
I'm sure he was happy
to die for you.

280
00:16:02,584 --> 00:16:04,250
I'm not even dead.

281
00:16:05,209 --> 00:16:08,250
And you're using me
as a human shield!

282
00:16:08,459 --> 00:16:10,584
You're going to pay for that!

283
00:16:12,918 --> 00:16:15,167
[deep rumbling]

284
00:16:18,501 --> 00:16:21,542
[rumbling continues]

285
00:16:25,751 --> 00:16:26,709
What's that?

286
00:16:29,834 --> 00:16:31,458
This keeps getting worse.

287
00:16:31,459 --> 00:16:32,417
Again?

288
00:16:32,876 --> 00:16:35,292
Maybe it's an even
bigger rabbit monster.

289
00:16:35,626 --> 00:16:38,124
If we hunt some more,
we could have another feast.

290
00:16:38,125 --> 00:16:39,917
We need to find
our way to the ocean

291
00:16:39,918 --> 00:16:41,000
and the Sunny first.

292
00:16:41,125 --> 00:16:43,250
We don't even know
if our crew is all right.

293
00:16:43,542 --> 00:16:45,042
You don't get to complain.

294
00:16:45,334 --> 00:16:46,667
We'd have some nice rations

295
00:16:46,792 --> 00:16:48,584
if you hadn't diced up
those bees.

296
00:16:48,751 --> 00:16:49,834
[buzzing]

297
00:16:50,042 --> 00:16:51,959
Honey is chock-full
of nutrients.

298
00:16:52,083 --> 00:16:53,792
And it won't go bad like meat.

299
00:16:54,083 --> 00:16:55,751
Now I want to try some!

300
00:16:55,876 --> 00:16:57,459
Man, what a waste!

301
00:16:57,626 --> 00:16:59,750
Sure is. You're a waste, cook!

302
00:16:59,751 --> 00:17:00,626
Hey!

303
00:17:01,042 --> 00:17:03,291
Am I really the only one
freaked out?

304
00:17:03,292 --> 00:17:04,751
Where the hell are we?

305
00:17:07,667 --> 00:17:10,209
Hey, do you guys know
how you ended up here?

306
00:17:10,542 --> 00:17:13,501
I woke up on the other side
of that town right over there.

307
00:17:13,667 --> 00:17:15,834
Heard some yelling,
followed the trail.

308
00:17:15,959 --> 00:17:18,541
Then I found Luffy
killing some big-ass rabbit.

309
00:17:18,542 --> 00:17:20,999
You could've beat
that cat lion alone, Usopp.

310
00:17:21,000 --> 00:17:22,124
It wasn't even tough.

311
00:17:22,125 --> 00:17:24,708
You try staying calm
when a cat's trying to eat you.

312
00:17:24,709 --> 00:17:26,167
I got scared, okay?

313
00:17:34,334 --> 00:17:36,834
[ALL screaming]

314
00:17:38,501 --> 00:17:40,375
Okay, Gum Gum.

315
00:17:41,667 --> 00:17:43,584
Balloon!

316
00:17:54,959 --> 00:17:56,375
My back is killing me!

317
00:17:56,918 --> 00:17:58,083
When does it end?

318
00:17:58,834 --> 00:18:00,751
So this place has giant monsters

319
00:18:00,918 --> 00:18:02,918
and this weird
fake-looking castle.

320
00:18:03,292 --> 00:18:06,167
It doesn't make any sense
if we're not hallucinating.

321
00:18:06,334 --> 00:18:08,709
Then could this be a dream?

322
00:18:09,125 --> 00:18:10,083
No.

323
00:18:10,709 --> 00:18:12,125
If this were a dream...

324
00:18:14,083 --> 00:18:16,167
there'd be no men
and more women.

325
00:18:16,417 --> 00:18:18,667
I don't think I want to hear
about your dreams.

326
00:18:19,792 --> 00:18:21,167
Never mind that, Nami.

327
00:18:23,375 --> 00:18:25,083
Let's fly!

328
00:18:26,292 --> 00:18:27,209
[NAMI] What?

329
00:18:27,626 --> 00:18:30,918
[screaming]

330
00:18:35,000 --> 00:18:38,083
[humming]

331
00:18:38,667 --> 00:18:41,918
[playful music playing]

332
00:18:43,792 --> 00:18:45,501
[humming]

333
00:18:59,751 --> 00:19:01,000
We're outside,

334
00:19:01,125 --> 00:19:03,501
but I can't feel
any wind at all.

335
00:19:07,959 --> 00:19:09,334
Hmm.

336
00:19:09,751 --> 00:19:10,834
Hmm-hmm.

337
00:19:10,959 --> 00:19:12,626
It's all coming together now.

338
00:19:12,751 --> 00:19:13,667
What is?

339
00:19:14,834 --> 00:19:16,709
Is this thing a tree?

340
00:19:17,375 --> 00:19:18,751
I figured it out!

341
00:19:19,876 --> 00:19:21,417
Just look at our clothes.

342
00:19:21,542 --> 00:19:23,458
Someone dressed us up
like warriors.

343
00:19:23,459 --> 00:19:25,416
We look like
we're from Elbaph, right?

344
00:19:25,417 --> 00:19:27,500
But if we're in the Country
of the Giants,

345
00:19:27,501 --> 00:19:29,541
they wouldn't have
clothes in our size.

346
00:19:29,542 --> 00:19:32,333
Unless our size changed as well!

347
00:19:32,334 --> 00:19:34,417
So you think this is Elbaph

348
00:19:34,542 --> 00:19:36,791
and we somehow
got turned into giants?

349
00:19:36,792 --> 00:19:38,917
Holy crap, I'm a giant?

350
00:19:38,918 --> 00:19:40,750
There's no way
in hell, that's it.

351
00:19:40,751 --> 00:19:42,667
I wonder why some of us
aren't here.

352
00:19:42,792 --> 00:19:44,250
Here on the island, I mean.

353
00:19:44,375 --> 00:19:45,667
How do you know that?

354
00:19:47,375 --> 00:19:50,124
Because my Ladydar
isn't detecting Robin.

355
00:19:50,125 --> 00:19:50,959
Your what?

356
00:19:51,292 --> 00:19:54,208
Okay guys, all we got to do
is head for the sea

357
00:19:54,209 --> 00:19:57,833
then I bet we'll find the Sunny
and all our friends with it.

358
00:19:57,834 --> 00:19:59,334
This place is massive.

359
00:19:59,459 --> 00:20:02,167
Wherever the sea is,
it's definitely not close.

360
00:20:02,667 --> 00:20:03,501
Nope.

361
00:20:03,834 --> 00:20:05,709
There should be people
in that town.

362
00:20:06,167 --> 00:20:07,958
I say we should go talk to them.

363
00:20:07,959 --> 00:20:09,374
We'll find out where we are

364
00:20:09,375 --> 00:20:10,958
and take it from there, I guess.

365
00:20:10,959 --> 00:20:12,751
All right, going to town!

366
00:20:12,876 --> 00:20:14,291
I'm going to get directions

367
00:20:14,292 --> 00:20:16,709
from the biggest,
most beautiful lady in town.

368
00:20:16,834 --> 00:20:18,042
Take this seriously!

369
00:20:18,167 --> 00:20:20,416
And the town's not
in that direction, Zoro.

370
00:20:20,417 --> 00:20:21,375
Oh, my bad.

371
00:20:23,626 --> 00:20:25,999
You're having way
too much fun with this, Luffy.

372
00:20:26,000 --> 00:20:26,958
It's no joke.

373
00:20:26,959 --> 00:20:29,417
Not only are we lost,
this place is not right.

374
00:20:29,626 --> 00:20:31,584
I'll keep you safe, it's okay.

375
00:20:31,751 --> 00:20:33,417
There's no need to worry.

376
00:20:34,125 --> 00:20:36,249
It doesn't matter
if we're in Elbaph

377
00:20:36,250 --> 00:20:40,417
because not even a giant
is bigger than my love for you.

378
00:20:40,751 --> 00:20:41,792
[sighs]

379
00:20:41,959 --> 00:20:44,583
If this really is Elbaph,
I'm disappointed

380
00:20:44,584 --> 00:20:47,082
there aren't any giant gold bars
I could borrow.

381
00:20:47,083 --> 00:20:49,125
You mean steal?
The word is steal.

382
00:20:49,250 --> 00:20:52,584
Okay, we'll check the town
and see what they know.

383
00:20:52,918 --> 00:20:54,918
Works for me. Let's go!

384
00:20:55,125 --> 00:20:57,583
Adventure!

385
00:20:57,584 --> 00:20:58,709
Yeah!

386
00:21:02,125 --> 00:21:03,959
Ja-ja giants!

387
00:21:04,125 --> 00:21:06,374
Ja-ja giants!

388
00:21:06,375 --> 00:21:08,458
Elbaph! Elbaph!

389
00:21:08,459 --> 00:21:10,417
Everyone is huge!

390
00:21:10,542 --> 00:21:14,834
They're so huge
because they're giants!

391
00:21:14,959 --> 00:21:16,375
[laughter]

392
00:21:23,626 --> 00:21:26,876
<i>Here I am straining
Both my eyes</i>

393
00:21:28,918 --> 00:21:32,626
<i>And checking
Where I am standing right now</i>

394
00:21:34,292 --> 00:21:38,709
<i>With my brain consumed
By all the delusion and despair</i>

395
00:21:38,876 --> 00:21:42,083
<i>I'm always bound to be
A little off somehow</i>

396
00:21:42,292 --> 00:21:46,375
<i>The things that come up vividly</i>

397
00:21:47,918 --> 00:21:51,209
<i>Are always the cruel memories</i>

398
00:21:53,501 --> 00:21:57,918
<i>I gather up the scraps
Of the simple boredom of my life</i>

399
00:21:58,042 --> 00:22:01,959
<i>I might turn into
Somebody else but me</i>

400
00:22:02,834 --> 00:22:05,834
<i>I wonder which future
Would fit someone like me now</i>

401
00:22:05,959 --> 00:22:08,791
<i>From here on no matter how hard</i>

402
00:22:08,792 --> 00:22:12,042
<i>I try to strain my eyes</i>

403
00:22:12,209 --> 00:22:15,584
<i>I'll still see nothing anyhow</i>

404
00:22:15,834 --> 00:22:18,917
<i>I'm riding the headwind</i>

405
00:22:18,918 --> 00:22:22,667
<i>I pour it into the tear
Of destiny</i>

406
00:22:23,042 --> 00:22:26,918
<i>As I split all
The false fantasies apart</i>

407
00:22:27,042 --> 00:22:28,334
<i>And everyone's</i>

408
00:22:28,501 --> 00:22:31,209
<i>Piling up their own
Life-or-death reality</i>

409
00:22:31,334 --> 00:22:33,833
<i>All the time just like that</i>

410
00:22:33,834 --> 00:22:36,709
<i>Then tomorrow comes
Way too loud</i>

411
00:22:36,834 --> 00:22:38,667
<i>Leaving no time
Even just to pray</i>

412
00:22:38,792 --> 00:22:41,918
<i>And that future we see</i>

413
00:22:43,000 --> 00:22:46,083
<i>It all belongs to me</i>

414
00:22:55,209 --> 00:22:56,791
<i>Luffy and his crewmates explore</i>

415
00:22:56,792 --> 00:22:58,501
<i>the mysterious
Kingdom of Blocks.</i>

416
00:22:58,626 --> 00:23:00,291
<i>Beyond the toy-like
countryside,</i>

417
00:23:00,292 --> 00:23:02,249
<i>they uncover
a disturbing secret.</i>

418
00:23:02,250 --> 00:23:04,626
<i>As they enter the so-called
Sun God's temple,</i>

419
00:23:04,751 --> 00:23:06,875
<i>they begin to unravel
this mystery.</i>

420
00:23:06,876 --> 00:23:08,416
<i>But when they find the truth,</i>

421
00:23:08,417 --> 00:23:10,918
<i>a new foe approaches
from the shadows.</i>

422
00:23:11,042 --> 00:23:12,709
On the next One Piece!

423
00:23:12,918 --> 00:23:16,751
"A quest in the Land of Mystery!
The secret of the Sun God!"

424
00:23:17,417 --> 00:23:19,459
I'm going to be
King of the Pirates!

